godot-editor-mcp 2026.10.15
https://github.com/hybridindie/godot-mcp/releases/tag/v2026.10.15

The vendored addon in addon/godot_mcp is an unmodified copy of the upstream
`godot/addons/godot_mcp` directory at that tag. Verify with:

    Get-FileHash addon/godot_mcp/plugin.cfg
    # version="2026.10.15" in plugin.cfg

Upstream is MIT licensed; see addon/LICENSE and NOTICE.

`addon/patches/` holds fixes that are offered upstream and deliberately **not**
applied to the tree above: `install.ps1` copies `addon/godot_mcp` verbatim, so
the "unmodified copy" promise holds. Each patch records the file and the sha256
it was cut from, and the test suite fails if the vendored file moves on without
the patch being refreshed.
